        Are Large Language Models Capable of Deep Relational Reasoning? Insights from DeepSeek-R1 and Benchmark Comparisons
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=So%2C+C+C">Chi Chiu So</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+Y">Yueyue Sun</a>, 
      
