        ReasonBridge: Efficient Reasoning Transfer from Closed to Open-Source Language Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhong%2C+Z">Ziqi Zhong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tang%2C+X">Xunzhu Tang</a>
      
