        QuickSilver -- Speeding up <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Inference</span> through Dynamic Token Halting, KV Skipping, Contextual Token Fusion, and Adaptive Matryoshka Quantization
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
