        SegChange-R1: <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span>-Augmented Remote Sensing Change Detection
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+F">Fei Zhou</a>
      
