        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.04722">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2503.04722">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2503.04722">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
