        Plant in Cupboard, Orange on Rably, Inat Aphone. Benchmarking Incremental Learning of Situation and Language Model using a Text-Simulated Situated Environment
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jordan%2C+J">Jonathan Jordan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hakimov%2C+S">Sherzod Hakimov</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Schlangen%2C+D">David Schlangen</a>
      
